{{define "body"}}<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">Join {{if .Params.project}}{{.Params.project}} in {{end}}{{.Params.org}} on Proreta</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">{{if .Params.inviter}}<strong>{{.Params.inviter}}</strong> invited you{{else}}You are invited{{end}} to join {{if .Params.project}}the project <strong>{{.Params.project}}</strong> in {{end}}<strong>{{.Params.org}}</strong> on Proreta as {{.Params.role}}.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">Proreta watches websites and services from outside and tells the team when one goes down.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px"><a href="{{.Link}}" style="color:#1a1a1a;font-weight:600">Accept the invitation</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;color:#6b6b63;word-break:break-all">If the link does not open, copy this address into your browser:<br>{{.Link}}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">The link works once and expires in {{.Params.expires}}. It is personal: anyone who has it can join, so do not forward it.</p>
<p style="margin:0">If you were not expecting this, ignore this message: nothing happens unless the link is opened.</p>{{end}}
{{define "footer"}}Sent by {{.PublicHost}}.{{end}}
